Methodology and citation
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The scientific methodology is published in docs/methodology/ and in the paper
under paper/. Every quantitative value the tool applies is traced to a cited
source in docs/methodology/BIBLIOGRAPHY.md. If you use this tool or its
methodology in published work, please cite the Methodology Report and record
the methodology version stamped on your results.
